OL,3,CParents charged with allowing death of
OL,4,Cone-year-old boy
OL,6,FA mother and father have been charged
OL,7,Fwith causing or allowing the death of
OL,8,Ftheir one-year-old boy three years
OL,9,Fafter he died.
OL,11,FMaero Johnson, from St Helens, died in
OL,12,Fhospital on 23 August 2023 due to
OL,13,Fsevere malnutrition and ketonic
OL,14,Fhypoglycaemia; a condition typically
OL,15,Fcaused by long periods without food or
OL,16,Fa viral illness.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
