PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1786121302
OL,3,CParents charged with allowing death of
OL,4,Cone-year-old boy
OL,6,FAdam Johnson, 26 and of Hempstead
OL,7,FClose, and 25-year-old Kylie Smith, of
OL,8,FHolly Bank Street, have been charged
OL,9,Fwith causing/allowing the death of a
OL,10,Fchild, child neglect, and possession
OL,11,Fof a Class B drug.
OL,13,FMerseyside Police say a second child
OL,14,Fwas also found to be neglected and
OL,15,Funderdeveloped.
OL,17,FMaero's parents will appear at
OL,18,FLiverpool Magistrates Court on
OL,19,FThursday 13 August 2026.
